breaking_changes.Adaptation_method:
Replace synchronous method calls with their asynchronous equivalents:

```javascript
// Before
const output = jsdoc2md.renderSync(options);

// After
const output = await jsdoc2md.render(options);
```

For examples of API usage, see https://github.com/jsdoc2md/jsdoc-to-markdown/wiki/How-to-create-one-output-file-per-class
